{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>-3</sup> - 0.001 = 0 হলে x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = ?", "option1": "ক) 99", "option2": "খ) 100", "option3": "গ) 101", "option4": "ঘ) 0.01", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>-3</sup> - 0.0001 = 0<br />বা, 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 0.001<br />বা, 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 1/10<sup>3</sup><br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> = 10<sup>3</sup><br />&there4; x = 10<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 10<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 101</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) 2y/x হতে কত বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল x/y হবে?", "option1": "ক) (2y<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option2": "খ) (x<sup>2</sup> - 2y<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option3": "গ) (y<sup>2</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "option4": "ঘ) (x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(2y/x) - (x/y) = (2y<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>)/xy</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x + y = 8, x - y = 6 হলে, {2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)}<sup>1/2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 100", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>লাইভ পরীক্ষায় টাইপের ভুলে রুট দ্বিতীয় বন্ধনীর ভেতরে ছিল। তবে, উত্তর বাতিল হবে না। অপশনে যেহেতু 'কোনটিই নয়' ছিল না তাই উত্তর কোনটি হতে পারে বুঝতে সমস্যা হওয়ার কথা না।</p><p>2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)<br />= (x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup><br />= 8<sup>2</sup> + 6<sup>2</sup><br />= 64 + 36<br />= 100<br /><br />&radic;{2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)}<br />= &radic;100<br />= 10</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) (x - 8)<sup>100</sup> = 0 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(x - 8)<sup>100</sup> = 0<br />বা, x - 8 = 0<br />&there4; x = 8</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) &radic;7 - x = y এবং x - &radic;3 = y হলে, 4xy = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 16", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>&radic;7 - x = y<br />&there4; x + y = &radic;7<br />আবার,<br />x - &radic;3 = y<br />&there4; x - y = &radic;3<br />&there4; 4xy = (x + y)<sup>2</sup> - (x - y)<sup>2</sup><br />= (&radic;7)<sup>2</sup> - (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup><br />= 7 -3<br />= 4</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 8x - 16y + 16 থেকে কত বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল পূর্ণবর্গ হবে।", "option1": "ক) -4xy", "option2": "খ) -2xy", "option3": "গ) 2xy", "option4": "ঘ) 4xy", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 8x - 16y + 16<br />= x<sup>2 </sup> + (2y)<sup>2</sup> + (4)<sup>2</sup> - 2.x.2y + 2.x.4 - 2.2y.4 + 4xy<br />=(x - 2y + 4)<sup>2</sup> + 4xy</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 0.1 &times; 0.1 = ?", "option1": "ক) 0.001", "option2": "খ) 0.01", "option3": "গ) 0.1", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>0.1, 0.1 দশমিকের পর মোট দু'টি অংক।<br />&there4; ফলাফলে ও তাই হবে।<br />&there4; 0.1 &times; 0.1 = 0.01</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) সর্বোচ্চ কত জনের মধ্যে 81 টি আম এবং 36 টি পেয়ারা সমান ভাবে ভাগ করে দেয়া যাবে?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 9", "option4": "ঘ) 12", "answer": "3", "exp": "81, 36 এর গ. সা.গু. = 9"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) দু’টি সংখ্যার সমষ্টি 2 এবং গুণফল 1 হলে, সংখ্যা দু’টির বিয়োগফল-", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "1 + 1 = 2 এবং 1 &times; 1 = 1<br />&there4; 1 - 1 = 0"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) 3/5 এর লব এবং হরের সাথে কোন একই সংখ্যা বিয়োগ করলে ভগ্নাংশটি 4/5 হবে?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -5", "option3": "গ) -4", "option4": "ঘ) -3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>ধরি,<br /> সংখ্যাটি x.<br />&there4; (3 - x)/(5 - x) = 4/5<br />বা, 15 - 5x = 20 - 4x<br />বা, -x = 5<br />&there4; x = -5</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> কে x - 2 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) -6", "option4": "ঘ) -8", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x - 2 ) x<sup>3</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> ( x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup><br />&