e4; ভগ্নাংশটি = 3/2</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) কোন ভগ্নাংশটি বৃহত্তম -", "option1": "ক) 12/17", "option2": "খ) 11/14", "option3": "গ) 5/8", "option4": "ঘ) 15/20", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>17, 14, 8, 20, এর ল. সা. গু. = 4760<br />4760 &divide; 17 = 280<br />&there4; 12/17 = (12 &times; 280)/(17 &times; 280) = 3360/4760<br />4760 &divide; 14 = 340<br />&there4; 11/14 = (11 &times; 340)/(14 &times; 340) = 3740/4760<br />4760 &divide; 8 = 595<br />&there4; 5/8 = (5 &times; 595)/(8 &times; 595) = 2975/4760<br />4760 &divide; 20 = 238<br />&there4; 15/20 = (15 &times; 238)/(20 &times; 238) = 3570/4760</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) (x - 1)<sup>-1</sup> = (-1)<sup>-1</sup> হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) -2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(x - 1)<sup>-1</sup> = (-1)<sup>-1</sup><br />বা, x - 1 = -1<br />&there4; x = 0</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x = 1/{(&radic;5) - 2} হলে, x<sup>6</sup> - 52x<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x = 1/{(&radic;5) - 2} = &radic;5 + 2<br />এবং 1/x = &radic;5 - 2<br />বা, x - (1/x) = 4 ........ (1)<br />বা, (x - (1/x))<sup>3</sup> = 4<sup>3</sup> = 64<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> - 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 3.x.(1/x)(x - (1/x)) = 64<br />বা, ((x<sup>6</sup> - 1)/x<sup>3</sup>) + 3.4 = 64 ........... [(1) নং থেকে]<br />বা, (x<sup>6</sup> - 1)/x<sup>3</sup> = 64 - 12 = 52<br />বা, x<sup>6</sup> - 1 = 52x<sup>3</sup><br />&there4; x<sup>6</sup> - 52x<sup>3</sup> = 1</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) a<sup>2</sup> + 16/a<sup>2</sup> = 8 হলে, a<sup>4</sup> - 1/a<sup>4</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 289/16", "option2": "খ) 256/16", "option3": "গ) 255/16", "option4": "ঘ) 225/16", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a<sup>2</sup> + 16/a<sup>2</sup> = 8<br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> + 16 = 8a<sup>2</sup><br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> - 8a<sup>2</sup> + 16 = 0<br />বা, (a<sup>2</sup> - 4)<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />বা, a<sup>2</sup> 